== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Dark Elf Shadowknight, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: 'Follow your destiny into the Lodge of Dead and master your skills, dark knight. Seek out [[Nezzka Tolax]], and give him this note. With his training, you will become a powerful soldier of Hate.'

Upon handing the note to [[Nezzka Tolax]]:

: [[Nezzka Tolax]] says, 'Hmmm, I hope you're tougher than you look. Here, put this on. There's no turning back now, punk. So, you'd better do well, got it?'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[The Dead]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Queen Cristanos Thex]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[King Aythox Thex]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Keepers of the Art]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Eldritch Collective]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Primordial Malice]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Black Training Tunic*]]. Good luck, Shadowknight!

